e series data.</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><volume>20</volume><fpage>5</fpage><lpage>20</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14693803</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006633-Willbrand1"><label>17</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Willbrand</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Radvanyi</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Nadal</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Thiery</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Fink</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Identifying genes from up-down properties of microarray expression series.</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><volume>21</volume><fpage>3859</fpage><lpage>3864</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16221984</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006633-Zhao1"><label>18</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zhao</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Prentice</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Breeden</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Statistical modeling of large microarray data sets to identify stimulus-response profiles.</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A</source><volume>98</volume><fpage>5631</fpage><lpage>5636</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11344303</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006633-EmmertStreib3"><label>19</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Emmert-Streib</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Dehmer</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><year>2009</year><article-title>Hierarchical coordination of periodic genes in the cell cycle of <italic>saccharomyces cer